  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 9.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et illi habeant suboperarios suos in suo crimine, quod purum faciant et recti ponderis, per eandum witam quam praediximus.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And they shall be responsible for the production by their employees of pure money of the proper weight, under pain of incurring the same fine as we have fixed above.</ab>
      </div>
